            "speaker_id": 136230,
            "reply_to": null,
            "text": "Hi team, welcome to the channel for the Warehouse Move & Office Records Consolidation project. The main goal is to re-layout the warehouse and consolidate our records to improve efficiency. Let's start by defining the scope. Who can help map out the initial areas for both warehouse and office?",
