              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M2",
            "speaker_id": 304178,
            "reply_to": "M1",
            "text": "Got it. So for the warehouse, are we doing all zones at once? I can start taking pictures of everything now.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M3",
            "speaker_id": 49303,
            "reply_to": "M2",
            "text": "Hold on, let's not get ahead of ourselves. We should probably focus on the high-turnover zones first, like receiving and outbound staging. Doing it all at once will block operations. I can mark those on a draft map for T1.",
