            "speaker_id": 53954,
            "reply_to": "M1",
            "text": "Good point on phasing. For the office side, we need a similar approach. We should inventory the records in the main admin area and the long-term storage room first, as part of T3. We need to be clear about what's being moved, what's being digitized, and what's being archived. This will feed into the Records and Supplies Inventory Log A3.",
