            "speaker_id": 53954,
            "reply_to": "M14",
            "text": "For the office side, moving the main admin area files should happen after 6 PM on a weekday. The basement archive can be done anytime, as it doesn't disrupt daily work. While we're scheduling, we should also plan T7, setting up the tracking log A6. We need to train the movers on how to use it before the first box is moved.",
