            "artifact_refs": [
              "A6"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M37",
            "speaker_id": 53954,
            "reply_to": "M34",
            "text": "The office archive move was successful. All boxes were tracked correctly in A6. One suggestion: could we add a 'digitization priority' column to the log? It would help us when we start T9. It also took a bit longer than scheduled in A5 because some boxes were heavier than expected.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A5",
              "A6",
              "T9"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "bulb",
                "count": 2
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M38",
            "speaker_id": 136230,
            "reply_to": "M37",
            "text": "Excellent feedback. So, the proposed changes are: 1) Adjust layout in A1 to widen Aisle 3. 2) Add a 'digitization priority' column to A6. 3) Add 30 minutes of buffer time to the office move slots in A5. Do we agree on these changes?",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A1",
              "A5",
              "A6"
